extern const char str_010dcee8[280] = "This gain controls the proportion of the difference in position that is applied " "to the bodies. It has the most immediate effect. High gain values make the contr" "oller very stiff. Once the controller is too stiff it will tend to overshoot. Th" "e velocity gain can help control this.\000";
extern const char str_010dd000[144] = "This gain controls the proportion of the difference in velocity that is applied " "to the bodies. It dampens the effects of the position control.\000";
